  "title": "FMC Corporation CEO Pierre Brondeau and CFO Andrew Sandifer to speak at Bank of America Global Agriculture and Materials Conference",
  "summary": "FMC Corporation (NYSE: FMC) today announced that Pierre Brondeau, FMC chairman, chief executive officer and president, and Andrew Sandifer, FMC executive vice president and chief financial officer, will speak at the Bank of America Global Agriculture and Materials conference on February 25, 2026, at 2:45 p.m. Eastern Time. A live webcast will be available at www.fmc.com/investors.",
